{"2600920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "When Sirens Fall Silent", "steam_appid": 2600920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1> </h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600920/extras/71fad1e6806aca70be035ff30ef76fd2.avif?t=1781519240\" width=1560 height=300 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Sirens Fall Silent is a dark, investigative, psychological thriller where you play as Mila, a determined policewoman in early 1990s Italy. ​Haunted by a past she's desperate to escape, Mila is thrust into a high-profile case of kidnappings and murders. As the investigation unravels, you must not only save her from herself, but also being swallowed up by a vortex of violence, mystery and confusion.​ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes the player on a journey, that explores themes of misogyny, trafficking, trauma, redemption and morality, blurring the lines between reality and perception. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600920/extras/088360887760f8d5bb09640c55a65671.avif?t=1781519240\" width=1560 height=150 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> The award winning titles that launched LKA to critical and fan acclaim.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600920/extras/870383f9bb9404017d1f7ed3ad0b1805.poster.avif?t=1781519240\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600920/extras/870383f9bb9404017d1f7ed3ad0b1805.webm?t=1781519240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600920/extras/870383f9bb9404017d1f7ed3ad0b1805.mp4?t=1781519240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600920/extras/094f4c510234e9bc1b37736767cedc28.avif?t=1781519240\" width=1560 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From real world issues of trafficking, to real life attitudes of misogyny, the team pull no punches.. with a few surprises along the way.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600920/extras/5ab895388535c5a2af3a3bce5eb00f49.poster.avif?t=1781519240\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600920/extras/5ab895388535c5a2af3a3bce5eb00f49.webm?t=1781519240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600920/extras/5ab895388535c5a2af3a3bce5eb00f49.mp4?t=1781519240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600920/extras/8a89e39663356bd379ada595f9706ecc.avif?t=1781519240\" width=1560 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find and piece together the clues to hunt down the criminal mastermind, from examining bodies to rooms full of potential answers.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600920/extras/90170fabcc518ad2246cb252ea32dd30.poster.avif?t=1781519240\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s